5.1 Participate in internal training specifically required by customer;
5.2 Responsible for training and guiding new product quality standard and inspection specification;
5.3 Assist quality control supervisor in recognizing and managing process  change points;
5.4 Responsible for compiling, archiving and transferring materials relating to new product development process.

6Nothing in the Position Description restricts management's right to assign or re-assign duties and responsibilities to this job at any time

